 "description": "In short, the Saffier SE 24 Lite is a 24-foot sailboat that is super fast and sails with ease and fun. This daysailer is powered by wind and electricity. The electric propulsion system is charged 24/7 by integrated solar panels. The Saffier SE 24 Lite is easily transportable and can be launched from a trailer or hoisted from the water by a single lifting point. This daysailer sails fast, fun and perfectly.\nThe Saffier SE 24 Lite provides the ultimate sailing experience. She can be sailed single-handed at full speed, picks up quickly and glides with ease. Whether you're out for a fast ride or a quiet moment with family and friends, she delivers. Above all, this sailboat won European Yacht of the Year 2024. Meet the striking new Saffier SE 24 Lite.",
 "credits": [
  {
   "label": "Design",
   "value": "D. Hennevanger / Kees van de Stadt"
  }
 ],
 "awards": [
  "European Yacht of the Year"
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Driven by nature",
   "intro": "A sailboat propelled by electricity and wind. The Saffier SE 24 Lite sailboat features integrated solar panels and is truly self-supporting.\nTo elaborate, the solar panels are custom-made and seamlessly integrated in the design of the foredeck of the SE 24 Lite. These custom solar panels generate enough power to constantly charge the Torqeedo 3.5 kW battery for electric propulsion any time, anywhere. Moreover, Instruments and lights can be removed from the daysailer and can be recharged in your car, back home or with a power bank. The Saffier SE 24 Lite can be sailed in complete silence, only hearing this 24-foot yacht slicing through the water. In other words, this daysailer is powered by nature.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Sailing very fast in a safe way",
   "intro": "In short, the Saffier SE 24 Lite was designed with speed, comfort and safety in mind.\nTherefore, this is a  24-foot sailboat that sails in full control, singlehanded with all sheets close at hand and showing double digits on your rechargeable display. The Saffier SE 24 Lite was designed with a modern hull shape with a good form stability in order to achieve high speeds. Moreover, this is achieved by a flat underwater section in the hull and a 2.40 m beam. A lightweight yacht is key for performance. Therefore, this 24-foot sailboat sails fun, fast, and perfect. She only brings fun and smiles during sailing in the sun, wind and water.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Trailer. Launch. Rig. Sail. All by yourself.",
   "intro": "The Saffier SE 24 Lite is built for independence at every stage: before, during and after your sail.\nLightweight and easy to handle, you can trailer the boat, launch it, step the mast and set sail, completely on your own. Whether you're heading out for a quick afternoon sail or a weekend adventure, the SE 24 Lite makes the entire process fast, simple, and fun.\n\nEverything is optimised for solo use, with smart rigging systems and intuitive controls. No crew needed. Just you, the wind and the freedom to sail when and where you want.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Award winning model",
   "intro": "The Saffier Se 24 Lite is a true game-changer in daysailing: lightweight, electric-powered, and easy to handle by anyone.\nThis innovative design has won both the HISWA Boot van het Jaar and the prestigious European Yacht of the Year award, making it one of the most celebrated yachts in its class.\n\nJudges praised the Se 24 Lite for its smart layout, sleek looks, and unmatched sailing fun. Whether you’re a beginner or a seasoned sailor, this yacht offers pure freedom: trailer it, launch it, rig it, and sail it—all by yourself.\n\nExperience award-winning innovation. Sail the future.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Reverse bow",
   "intro": "The Saffier SE 24 Lite has a reverse bow. This gives the 24-foot sailboat her modern and sharp look. This sailing yacht with her negative bow cuts through the waves like a knife.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Spacious cockpit",
   "intro": "A closer look at the cockpit of this sailboat reveals her family character: a large uncluttered cockpit for 6 persons with sundeck and easy access from the shore.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Rechargeable instruments",
   "intro": "Instruments and lights can be removed from the sailing yacht and recharged in your car, back home or with a power bank. This daysailer is driven by nature.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "No compromises in materials",
   "intro": "Built with premium materials, no compromises. The Se 24 Lite offers top quality, durability and style, just like any other Saffier yacht.",
